---
import Verticalgrid from "../assets/Verticalgrid.astro";
---
<section class="relative border-t border-y border-white/5 bg-[#f9f9f9]">
  
  <div class="relative px-8 py-12 mx-auto max-w-7xl md:px-12 lg:px-16 lg:py-[72px]">
        <div class=" max-w-7xl">
            <h2 class="">Why 99minds and Klaviyo</h2>
            <p class="mt-4">Happy customers stick around and our app knows it. Think of your best customers. Now imagine keeping them happy all the time. That's where our app and Klaviyo come in. Repeat customers are 50% more likely to try a new product and spend 31% more per purchase than new customers.
              <br/ >
              Using 99mindsand Klaviyo together allows you to create segmented audiences to power bulk gift cards & hyper-personalized email and SMS campaigns that will delight and reward your most loyal customers</p>
        </div>
    <div class="text-center max-w-2xl lg:mt-16 mt-10 mx-auto">
      <h2 class="text-3xl font-normal tracking-tight text-balance text-black">When loyalty data meets communication</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 mt-16 -mx-4 gap-y-10 sm:mx-auto lg:max-w-none md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-x-10 lg:mx-0">
     <div class="flex flex-col p-[0.060rem] rounded-3xl ">
        <div class="h-full p-8 bg-white rounded-3xl border border-gray-200 flex flex-col justify-between">
          <div>
            <h3 class="mt-5">
              <span class="text-3xl">2.3X</span>
            </h3>
            <p class="mt-2 ">Higher customer lifetime value from loyalty members</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="flex flex-col p-[0.060rem] rounded-3xl ">
        <div class="h-full p-8 bg-white rounded-3xl border border-gray-200">
          <h3 class="mt-5 text-xl text-black">
            <span class="text-3xl">$60%</span>
          </h3>
          <p class="mt-2 ">Higher average order value</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="flex flex-col p-[0.060rem] rounded-3xl ">
        <div class="h-full p-8 bg-white rounded-3xl border border-gray-200 flex flex-col justify-between">
          <div>
            <h3 class="mt-5 text-xl text-black">
              <span class="text-3xl">325%</span>
            </h3>
            <p class="mt-2 ">Increase in revenue during peak loyalty promotion</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>



